#: ../../source/example_gallery/open_domain_wave.rst:2
#: c3ad7dd85b8f4296b6d6836e9984bdce
msgid "Open-Domain Wave (PML & Ports)"
msgstr "开放域波动（PML 与端口）"

#: ../../source/example_gallery/open_domain_wave.rst:4
#: 270b55f803894cf78acf6ab57cd7e4db
msgid ""
"Frequency-domain wave problems on **open** domains need two ingredients "
"beyond the plain complex Helmholtz assembly of :doc:`complex`: a way to "
"drive and absorb waves at a boundary (**ports** / first-order absorbing "
"conditions), and a **perfectly matched layer** (PML) that soaks up outgoing "
"radiation without reflection. Both shipped as small, composable operators:"
msgstr ""
"开放域上的频域波动问题除了 :doc:`complex` 中介绍的复值亥姆霍兹装配之外，还需要两个要素：在边界上驱动和吸收波的方法（\\ **端口** "
"/ 一阶吸收边界条件），以及吸收 outgoing 辐射而不产生反射的\\ **完全匹配层**\\ （PML）。两者均以小型、可组合算子的形式提供："

#: ../../source/example_gallery/open_domain_wave.rst:11
#: 8fd0526106e64379b1e41434a7663047
msgid ""
":func:`~tensormesh.robin_operator` / :func:`~tensormesh.port_source` — the "
"boundary matrix :math:`\\int_\\Gamma c\\,N_iN_j\\,\\mathrm dS` and incident "
"load of a Robin / impedance / plane-wave-port condition, built on "
":class:`~tensormesh.FacetBilinearAssembler` (the bilinear counterpart of "
":class:`~tensormesh.FacetAssembler`);"
msgstr ""
":func:`~tensormesh.robin_operator` / :func:`~tensormesh.port_source` —— 罗宾 /"
" 阻抗 / 平面波端口条件的边界矩阵 :math:`\\int_\\Gamma c\\,N_iN_j\\,\\mathrm dS` 和入射载荷，基于 "
":class:`~tensormesh.FacetBilinearAssembler` 构建（\\ "
":class:`~tensormesh.FacetAssembler` 的双线性对应物）；"

#: ../../source/example_gallery/open_domain_wave.rst:16
#: a67706d26c0a4770820d0531a2a66a31
msgid ""
":func:`~tensormesh.functional.pml.cartesian_pml` — the stretched-coordinate "
"PML tensor :math:`\\mathbf\\Lambda` and mass scaling, consumed by "
":class:`~tensormesh.AnisotropicLaplaceElementAssembler` and "
":class:`~tensormesh.assemble.ScaledMassElementAssembler`."
msgstr ""
":func:`~tensormesh.functional.pml.cartesian_pml` —— 拉伸坐标 PML 张量 "
":math:`\\mathbf\\Lambda` 及质量缩放，供 "
":class:`~tensormesh.AnisotropicLaplaceElementAssembler` 和 "
":class:`~tensormesh.assemble.ScaledMassElementAssembler` 使用。"

#: ../../source/example_gallery/open_domain_wave.rst:21
#: 8c29d9c46b774dd29dd907c61ac30708
msgid ""
"Two worked examples in ``examples/wave/`` exercise them — an acoustic "
"resonator driven through a port, and a photonic microdisk wrapped in a PML "
"frame."
msgstr ""
"``examples/wave/`` 中的两个完整示例展示了它们的用法 —— 一个通过端口驱动的声学谐振器，以及一个包裹在 PML 框架中的光子微盘。"

#: ../../source/example_gallery/open_domain_wave.rst:27
#: b2deebe7bd2e4ad187fb738f14b4657b
msgid "Helmholtz resonator (acoustics, ports)"
msgstr "亥姆霍兹谐振器（声学，端口）"

#: ../../source/example_gallery/open_domain_wave.rst:29
#: 9c80ff775a7a4b7797f79cc1d302f9cf
msgid ""
"``examples/wave/helmholtz_resonator/helmholtz_resonator.py`` solves a 2D "
"duct with a necked side cavity — the textbook Helmholtz resonator — driven "
"by a plane-wave port at the inlet. All walls are sound-hard (natural "
"Neumann); the port both injects the incident wave and absorbs the "
"reflection:"
msgstr ""
"``examples/wave/helmholtz_resonator/helmholtz_resonator.py`` 求解一个带有颈缩侧腔的二维管道"
" —— 经典的亥姆霍兹谐振器 —— 由入口处的平面波端口驱动。所有壁面均为刚性（自然诺伊曼边界条件）；端口同时注入入射波并吸收反射波："

#: ../../source/example_gallery/open_domain_wave.rst:35
#: baa8908d727f47cf9731ea99e3133880
msgid ""
"\\frac{\\partial p}{\\partial n} + i k\\, p = 2 i k\\, p_0\n"
"\\quad\\text{on } \\Gamma_{\\text{port}} ."
msgstr ""
"\\frac{\\partial p}{\\partial n} + i k\\, p = 2 i k\\, p_0\n"
"\\quad\\text{在 } \\Gamma_{\\text{port}} \\text{ 上}。"

#: ../../source/example_gallery/open_domain_wave.rst:40
#: 7dacbafb72404d7b876d8e7ce32c2eda
msgid ""
"In the weak form that is one boundary matrix and one boundary load on top of"
" the usual stiffness/mass pair — the whole recipe is four lines:"
msgstr "在弱形式中，这对应于常规刚度/质量矩阵对之上增加的一个边界矩阵和一个边界载荷 —— 整个实现仅需四行代码："

#: ../../source/example_gallery/open_domain_wave.rst:43
#: 86fd81598cb54c2785008ca3d80326a3
msgid "examples/wave/helmholtz_resonator/helmholtz_resonator.py (essence)"
msgstr "examples/wave/helmholtz_resonator/helmholtz_resonator.py（核心部分）"

#: ../../source/example_gallery/open_domain_wave.rst:56
#: 8e9add91db114303830ed44c4700668c
msgid ""
"Sweeping the frequency and reading the input impedance :math:`Z(f) = "
"p_{\\text{avg}} / u_{\\text{in}}` at the inlet produces the resonance "
"spectrum; the fundamental sits at **357 Hz** with a cavity pressure gain of "
"~12x over the incident amplitude."
msgstr ""
"扫描频率并读取入口处的输入阻抗 :math:`Z(f) = p_{\\text{avg}} / u_{\\text{in}}`\\ "
"，即可得到谐振谱；基频位于 **357 Hz**\\ ，腔体压力增益约为入射幅值的 12 倍。"

#: ../../source/example_gallery/open_domain_wave.rst:61
#: e2ef6f625d714e0e9b0165f9dc9314d7
msgid "Helmholtz resonator pressure field and SPL at resonance"
msgstr "亥姆霍兹谐振器在谐振时的压力场与声压级"

#: ../../source/example_gallery/open_domain_wave.rst:66
#: 07f03c8d9444472e846af28485f598bb
msgid ""
"The acoustic field at resonance: total pressure (top) and sound pressure "
"level (bottom). The cavity rings at a nearly uniform high pressure while the"
" duct stays quiet — the classic pressure-node line cuts across the neck."
msgstr "谐振时的声场：总压力（上）和声压级（下）。腔体以近乎均匀的高压振荡，而管道保持安静 —— 经典的压力节线横贯颈部。"

#: ../../source/example_gallery/open_domain_wave.rst:71
#: fca0905653b74fc5b357e97fddf913af
msgid "Input impedance over the frequency sweep"
msgstr "频率扫描的输入阻抗"

#: ../../source/example_gallery/open_domain_wave.rst:76
#: 8d4502982a3d481b8e8ac1e278f70c90
msgid ""
"Input impedance :math:`|Z|/Z_0` over the sweep — the Helmholtz resonance and"
" the duct harmonics appear as peaks, with anti-resonances between them."
msgstr "扫描过程中的输入阻抗 :math:`|Z|/Z_0` —— 亥姆霍兹谐振和管道谐波表现为峰值，其间存在反谐振点。"

#: ../../source/example_gallery/open_domain_wave.rst:82
#: 82b1cb2e38d04fd8beb4b5160d9daac9
msgid "Optical ring resonator (photonics, PML)"
msgstr "光学环形谐振器（光子学，PML）"

#: ../../source/example_gallery/open_domain_wave.rst:84
#: 377fba573dad4c659fca4ba56d8c067a
msgid ""
"``examples/wave/optical_ring_resonator/optical_ring_resonator.py`` is a 2D "
"TM photonic solve: a silicon bus waveguide evanescently couples light into a"
" silicon microdisk (:math:`n = 3.48`) in silica cladding (:math:`n = 1.44`),"
" and a stretched-coordinate PML frame makes the computational box behave as "
"an open domain. The out-of-plane field :math:`E_z` obeys the PML-modified "
"Helmholtz equation"
msgstr ""
"``examples/wave/optical_ring_resonator/optical_ring_resonator.py`` 是一个二维 TM "
"光子学求解：硅总线波导通过倏逝耦合将光导入硅微盘（\\ :math:`n = 3.48`\\ ），周围为二氧化硅包层（\\ :math:`n = "
"1.44`\\ ），拉伸坐标 PML 框架使计算域表现为开放域。面外电场 :math:`E_z` 服从 PML 修正的亥姆霍兹方程"

#: ../../source/example_gallery/open_domain_wave.rst:91
#: 813229a75e8147478b8d19002da42f18
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\\nabla\\cdot(\\mathbf\\Lambda\\,\\nabla E_z)\n"
"+ k_0^2\\,\\varepsilon_r\\, s_x s_y\\, E_z = \\text{source},\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"\\mathbf\\Lambda = \\operatorname{diag}(s_y/s_x,\\ s_x/s_y),"
msgstr ""
"\\nabla\\cdot(\\mathbf\\Lambda\\,\\nabla E_z)\n"
"+ k_0^2\\,\\varepsilon_r\\, s_x s_y\\, E_z = \\text{source},\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"\\mathbf\\Lambda = \\operatorname{diag}(s_y/s_x,\\ s_x/s_y),"

#: ../../source/example_gallery/open_domain_wave.rst:98
#: 3f742414d7694907913c78b5dbde751e
msgid ""
"with :math:`s_x = s_y = 1` outside the layer. The reusable library path is "
"three calls:"
msgstr "其中层外 :math:`s_x = s_y = 1`\\ 。可复用的库调用路径仅需三次调用："

#: ../../source/example_gallery/open_domain_wave.rst:111
#: c662ca847ab1463cb80476a7bcac4da3
msgid ""
"(The example itself evaluates :math:`\\varepsilon_r` and the stretch per "
"quadrature point with an inline assembler for sharper Si/SiO₂ interfaces; "
"the ``cartesian_pml`` path reproduces the same operator and matches the 2D "
"Hankel Green function to correlation **0.994**.) A modal soft source "
"launches the guided bus mode directionally toward the disk."
msgstr ""
"（该示例本身通过内联装配器逐求积点计算 :math:`\\varepsilon_r` 和拉伸函数，以获得更锐利的 Si/SiO₂ 界面；\\ "
"``cartesian_pml`` 路径复现了相同的算子，并与二维汉克尔格林函数的相关性达到 **0.994**\\ "
"。）模态软源以定向方式将导波总线模式发射向微盘。"

#: ../../source/example_gallery/open_domain_wave.rst:117
#: f489f48855e24009bf3ed0902ea45ca6
msgid "Waveguide-coupled silicon microdisk on resonance"
msgstr "谐振时的波导耦合硅微盘"

#: ../../source/example_gallery/open_domain_wave.rst:121
#: 3f980c342bcc43f2a766c26e873f360e
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"On resonance the disk lights up in a whispering-gallery mode — a bright rim "
"of azimuthal lobes (left: :math:`\\mathrm{Re}\\,E_z`, right: :math:`|E_z|`),"
" the bus waveguide visibly depleted past the coupling point, and the PML "
"frame absorbing the radiated field."
msgstr ""
"谐振时，微盘在耳语廊模式中点亮 —— 明亮的方位角瓣环（左：\\ :math:`\\mathrm{Re}\\,E_z`\\ ，右：\\ "
":math:`|E_z|`\\ ），总线波导在耦合点之后明显衰减，PML 框架吸收辐射场。"

#: ../../source/example_gallery/open_domain_wave.rst:126
#: 1c4cc258293248e2a7b094fb4a1426ae
msgid "Materials, launch plane, and PML frame of the optical example"
msgstr "光学示例的材料、发射平面与 PML 框架"

#: ../../source/example_gallery/open_domain_wave.rst:131
#: 10fbe179f8604ca29c51a49135cec0d5
msgid ""
"The setup: materials, the two-plane directional launch, and the PML frame. "
"Without the PML a hard box traps the radiation into a standing wave of ~8x "
"the amplitude."
msgstr "设置：材料、双向定向发射平面以及 PML 框架。若无 PML，硬壁边界会将辐射囚禁为驻波，幅值约为原来的 8 倍。"

#: ../../source/example_gallery/open_domain_wave.rst:137
#: 70e1e76e124e473ea0603b65ee1ce3c4
msgid "Running them"
msgstr "运行示例"

#: ../../source/example_gallery/open_domain_wave.rst:144
#: 38e6c9c43c8740f5bbcd4c8df7024b3c
msgid ""
"Both expose ``run_demo(...)`` returning diagnostics plus ``--no-plot`` / "
"``--output`` flags; the optical script also takes ``--lam0-nm``, ``--order``"
" and ``--mesh-h-nm`` (with P1 elements numerical dispersion blue-shifts the "
"physical 1.55 µm resonance to the default 1512 nm)."
msgstr ""
"两者均提供返回诊断信息的 ``run_demo(...)`` 函数，以及 ``--no-plot`` / ``--output`` 标志；光学脚本还接受"
" ``--lam0-nm``\\ 、\\ ``--order`` 和 ``--mesh-h-nm``\\ （使用 P1 单元时，数值色散会将物理 "
"1.55 µm 的谐振蓝移至默认的 1512 nm）。"

#: ../../source/example_gallery/open_domain_wave.rst:151
